# Project Documentation

## Speech Recognition System (Internship Task - 4)

---

### 1. Project Overview

This project focuses on building a basic speech recognition system using an embedded platform such as Arduino or Raspberry Pi along with a speech module (e.g., Voice Recognition Module V3 or Elechouse VR Module). The system is capable of recognizing pre-trained voice commands and using them to control electrical devices such as lights, fans, etc.

---

### 2. Objective

* Design and implement a basic voice-activated control system.
* Train and recognize voice commands using a speech recognition module.
* Use voice commands to control devices (e.g., LEDs, relays).
* Demonstrate a complete working demo with output response.

---

### 3. Components Required

| Component                      | Quantity  |
| ------------------------------ | --------- |
| Arduino Uno                    | 1         |
| Voice Recognition Module (VR3) | 1         |
| Relay Module / LEDs            | 2         |
